      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<color=#9E5C24>Object</color>. Reforged from the shards of an ancient blade, carried by the king who reclaimed the throne of Sunlands.\n\n\u2022 <sprite name=\"sword\">Weapons - equip at a destination that trades in them\n\u2022 +1<sprite name=\"commander\">\n\u2022 <link=\"ability:Encouraging\"><u>Encouraging</u> <sprite name=\"encouraging\"></link> 100%\n\n<align=\"center\"><color=#d3d3d388><i>\"The Sword that was Broken shall be Reforged.\"</i></color></align>"
